WEBVTT

00:06.630 --> 00:07.880
Mother, look!

00:07.970 --> 00:09.050
I scored 100!

00:11.550 --> 00:13.390
How diligent of you.

00:13.470 --> 00:14.560
That's really amazing.

00:31.660 --> 00:32.780
<i>I see.</i>

00:33.780 --> 00:36.490
<i>I'm sure this isn't enough to satisfy her.</i>

00:37.160 --> 00:39.370
<i>If I don't deliver more
and better results,</i>

00:39.460 --> 00:42.250
<i>Mother won't ever be truly happy.</i>

00:46.840 --> 00:48.260
Enough, stop playing!

00:50.760 --> 00:53.140
Please stop.

01:00.060 --> 01:02.520
I just remembered something unpleasant.

01:04.770 --> 01:06.400
This is no good.

01:07.150 --> 01:08.900
Can't believe I caught a cold.

02:43.330 --> 02:45.120
Coming.

02:47.580 --> 02:49.130
Alya?

02:49.210 --> 02:50.500
Well…

02:50.590 --> 02:52.590
Did you hear it from Yuki?

02:52.670 --> 02:53.510
Yes.

02:53.590 --> 02:55.380
She said you were down with a cold

02:55.470 --> 02:57.720
and asked me to bring you some medicine.

02:57.800 --> 02:59.140
I see.

02:59.720 --> 03:00.760
<i>That girl</i>

03:00.850 --> 03:03.140
<i>should have at least told me beforehand.</i>

03:03.220 --> 03:05.390
Can I come in for a bit?

03:05.480 --> 03:07.190
What? No need for that.

03:07.270 --> 03:09.770
Just bringing the meds is enough.

03:09.860 --> 03:12.320
It was Yuki who asked me to come.

03:12.400 --> 03:14.900
She wanted me to take care of you.

03:14.990 --> 03:16.200
<i>My little sister,</i>

03:16.280 --> 03:18.870
<i>don't use your otaku brain to harm others.</i>

03:19.700 --> 03:21.120
It's actually a lie.

03:21.200 --> 03:23.620
<i>Sorry, I wrongfully accused you…</i>

03:25.160 --> 03:26.830
Pardon my intrusion.

03:29.420 --> 03:31.710
You don't have to be so nervous.

03:31.790 --> 03:34.710
I'm not nervous.

03:34.800 --> 03:37.340
Just a little restless.

03:38.010 --> 03:41.680
After all, this place smells like a guy.

03:41.760 --> 03:44.180
<i>Don't whisper something like that!</i>

03:44.680 --> 03:46.100
Well…

03:46.180 --> 03:48.980
So, which would you like,
porridge or borscht?

03:49.060 --> 03:50.690
Why these two?

03:51.480 --> 03:54.030
Borscht is good for you.

03:54.110 --> 03:56.440
The vegetables are stewed
until they're soft,

03:56.530 --> 03:58.450
so it's easy to eat even if you're weak.

03:58.530 --> 04:00.110
All right.

04:00.200 --> 04:02.240
Well, since you said so,
I'll have borscht.

04:02.330 --> 04:03.370
I see.

04:03.450 --> 04:04.790
Then wait for four hours.

04:04.870 --> 04:07.500
Who would wait? Who exactly would wait?

04:07.580 --> 04:08.960
If I use a pressure cooker,

04:09.040 --> 04:10.540
it'll take less time.

04:10.630 --> 04:11.920
But it's unorthodox.

04:12.000 --> 04:13.880
Then I'll go with regular porridge.

04:13.960 --> 04:14.960
Okay.

04:15.050 --> 04:17.130
Well then, let me borrow the kitchen.

04:18.840 --> 04:20.010
Let's see.

04:20.090 --> 04:22.510
When you use instant rice,

04:23.260 --> 04:26.020
you should microwave it first.

04:29.560 --> 04:31.650
<i>So he has been using it.</i>

04:33.690 --> 04:35.780
Wait. Which step was I on?

04:40.950 --> 04:43.280
Kuze, I brought you porridge.

04:48.120 --> 04:50.500
Thank you for wearing the apron for me.

04:50.580 --> 04:53.040
Looks like you're doing better
than I thought.

04:53.670 --> 04:55.040
Can you eat?

04:55.130 --> 04:56.300
I think so.

04:56.380 --> 04:57.510
Here.

04:57.590 --> 04:58.760
Thank you.

05:02.300 --> 05:03.300
It's yummy.

05:03.390 --> 05:04.260
Is it?

05:07.470 --> 05:08.310
Well,

05:08.890 --> 05:09.810
where are your parents?

05:11.140 --> 05:12.690
Dad is working.

05:12.770 --> 05:14.020
I don't have a mom.

05:14.110 --> 05:14.940
What?

05:15.020 --> 05:17.190
We're a single-father household.

05:18.400 --> 05:19.610
I see.

05:21.400 --> 05:23.950
Thank you for the food. It was delicious.

05:24.030 --> 05:25.280
It's just a simple meal.

05:25.370 --> 05:26.950
Have you taken your meds?

05:27.040 --> 05:27.870
Yes.

05:27.950 --> 05:29.910
Well then, I'm going back to sleep.

05:30.000 --> 05:31.410
You can go home now.

05:31.500 --> 05:32.420
It's fine.

05:32.500 --> 05:34.330
I'll study in the living room.

05:34.420 --> 05:36.710
No, you don't have to do that.

05:37.300 --> 05:40.260
A sick person
shouldn't worry unnecessarily.

05:41.300 --> 05:42.800
Yes.

05:52.310 --> 05:53.980
<i>Goodness, I slept way too long.</i>

05:54.560 --> 05:57.070
<i>Alya must have gone home, right?</i>

06:03.570 --> 06:05.910
Kuze, can you get out of bed now?

06:05.990 --> 06:08.740
Master Masachika, how are you feeling?

06:09.410 --> 06:11.700
Please lean on my shoulder.

06:12.710 --> 06:16.500
It'll look like I'm wrapping my arm
around a maid's shoulder.

06:16.580 --> 06:17.540
In this day and age,

06:17.630 --> 06:20.380
you never know which part
might be clipped and criticized.

06:20.460 --> 06:22.420
What are you talking about?

06:22.510 --> 06:25.130
Anyway, Kimishima, let go of him.

06:25.220 --> 06:28.300
No, this is also a maid's duty.

06:28.390 --> 06:30.680
You're not Kuze's maid,

06:30.770 --> 06:32.140
but Yuki's, aren't you?

06:34.640 --> 06:39.400
Mistress Yuki ordered me
to take care of Master Masachika.

06:39.480 --> 06:41.650
Therefore, it's my duty as a maid.

06:42.990 --> 06:44.200
That's how it is.

06:44.280 --> 06:46.490
I'll be taking over
Master Masachika's care now.

06:46.570 --> 06:48.120
It's getting late, after all.

06:48.200 --> 06:49.870
Please return home, Mistress Alisa.

06:50.370 --> 06:51.910
<i>Hey, watch what you say!</i>

06:53.500 --> 06:54.620
Besides,

06:54.710 --> 06:58.040
Mistress Alisa, shouldn't you
be busy preparing for tomorrow?

06:59.040 --> 06:59.880
Tomorrow?

06:59.960 --> 07:01.300
Is something happening tomorrow?

07:01.380 --> 07:02.300
No.

07:02.380 --> 07:04.010
I just have to go to school.

07:04.670 --> 07:05.720
I'll go home now.

07:08.970 --> 07:11.930
Well then, please take care of Kuze.

07:12.010 --> 07:13.770
Yes, please leave it to me.

07:14.640 --> 07:16.850
Well then, Kuze, see you tomorrow.

07:17.900 --> 07:19.150
See you tomorrow.

07:26.360 --> 07:29.280
This is the borscht
prepared by Mistress Alisa.

07:29.370 --> 07:30.280
Okay.

07:30.370 --> 07:31.660
Please enjoy.

07:31.740 --> 07:32.910
Thank you.

07:33.620 --> 07:34.950
I'm digging in.

07:41.670 --> 07:43.170
It's so good.

07:47.510 --> 07:49.180
Thank you for the food.

07:49.260 --> 07:51.680
Master Masachika, here's your medicine.

07:51.760 --> 07:53.180
Thank you.

07:54.770 --> 07:57.190
Now that I've eaten, I feel sleepy again.

07:57.270 --> 08:00.190
Master Masachika,
would you like to take a bath?

08:01.060 --> 08:02.900
I'll pass for today.

08:02.980 --> 08:06.690
In that case, I'll wipe your body for you.

08:06.780 --> 08:07.650
No need.

08:07.740 --> 08:08.950
You don't have to worry.

08:09.030 --> 08:10.780
I will cover my eyes.

08:10.870 --> 08:13.200
No, how can you wipe my body
with a blindfold?

08:14.120 --> 08:16.120
It's fine. I'll just sleep.

08:17.750 --> 08:19.080
Then I'll sleep with you.

08:19.170 --> 08:20.500
I said, no need.

08:20.580 --> 08:22.170
At least let me sing a lullaby.

08:22.250 --> 08:23.250
No need, no need.

08:26.510 --> 08:27.920
Stare.

08:28.010 --> 08:29.180
Ayano.

08:29.260 --> 08:30.380
Yes, what is it?

08:30.970 --> 08:32.090
This is an order.

08:32.180 --> 08:34.010
Go and sleep in Yuki's room.

08:34.100 --> 08:35.390
As you wish.

08:36.850 --> 08:38.430
Good night.

08:39.020 --> 08:40.020
Okay.

08:43.980 --> 08:46.780
<i>I should have done that from the start.</i>

08:52.990 --> 08:53.950
Good morning.

08:54.030 --> 08:56.290
Good morning, Master Masachika.

08:57.870 --> 08:59.040
Seriously?

08:59.120 --> 09:00.790
I slept way too long.

09:00.870 --> 09:03.460
Did you end up taking the day off too?

09:03.540 --> 09:05.630
Taking care of the sick Master Masachika

09:05.710 --> 09:08.300
was more important
than handing out test papers.

09:08.380 --> 09:10.800
May I know how you are feeling?

09:10.880 --> 09:12.590
Much better now.

09:12.680 --> 09:14.300
That's good.

09:14.390 --> 09:16.720
I shall prepare your meal right away.

09:16.810 --> 09:18.430
Thank you.

09:21.520 --> 09:23.310
Thank you for the food.

09:23.400 --> 09:26.320
It seems like
you have regained your appetite.

09:26.400 --> 09:27.610
However, just in case,

09:27.690 --> 09:30.190
please rest at home today.

09:31.110 --> 09:34.450
Well, it's after school anyway.

09:34.530 --> 09:36.490
Master Masachika, here's your medicine.

09:36.580 --> 09:37.450
Okay.

09:37.540 --> 09:39.200
Thank… you.

09:41.370 --> 09:42.500
<i>What's going on?</i>

09:42.580 --> 09:44.290
<i>Does something seem off?</i>

09:44.380 --> 09:47.170
What's the matter, Master Masachika?

09:49.010 --> 09:49.920
Ayano.

09:50.010 --> 09:52.050
Show me the packaging of this medicine.

09:53.880 --> 09:54.930
Ayano?

09:56.390 --> 09:58.180
As you wish.

09:58.260 --> 10:00.180
MEDICINE

10:00.270 --> 10:01.390
Given my constitution,

10:01.480 --> 10:03.810
this medicine will make me sleepy, right?

10:04.810 --> 10:06.400
Yes.

10:06.480 --> 10:07.690
If you knew that,

10:07.770 --> 10:09.690
why didn't you warn me?

10:11.530 --> 10:13.610
I'm very sorry.

10:13.700 --> 10:16.070
Giving medicine that doesn't match
your constitution

10:16.160 --> 10:17.700
is an unforgivable act.

10:17.780 --> 10:19.790
I'm willing to accept any punishment.

10:20.910 --> 10:24.210
Was it Yuki who instructed Alya
to buy this medicine?

10:27.080 --> 10:28.380
I'm going to school.

10:29.840 --> 10:31.880
It's better for you to get more rest…

10:31.960 --> 10:33.130
I'm okay.

10:33.220 --> 10:34.970
But, well…

10:35.050 --> 10:36.390
What's wrong?

10:36.470 --> 10:37.890
If you rush over now,

10:37.970 --> 10:39.640
it might already be too late.

10:40.350 --> 10:41.350
What?

10:41.850 --> 10:43.520
SEIREN ACADEMY

10:45.600 --> 10:47.900
That heiress is really amazing.

10:47.980 --> 10:50.020
Princess Alya seemed
to be doing her best too,

10:50.110 --> 10:52.030
but she's on a different level.

10:53.360 --> 10:55.490
Damn it! I was too careless.

10:55.570 --> 10:58.780
I thought nothing would happen
until the closing ceremony.

10:58.870 --> 11:01.410
I didn't expect her
to set up a trap at this time.

11:05.750 --> 11:06.920
Alya!

11:08.170 --> 11:09.420
Kuze?

11:11.170 --> 11:12.380
What happened?

11:14.380 --> 11:15.880
I'm sorry.

11:15.970 --> 11:18.590
I failed.

11:18.680 --> 11:21.390
You tried so hard to help me.

11:22.260 --> 11:23.520
But I…

11:25.730 --> 11:27.770
It happened yesterday morning.

11:27.850 --> 11:29.400
Yuki suddenly called me out.

11:29.480 --> 11:30.820
STUDENT COUNCIL OFFICE

11:30.900 --> 11:32.900
Kuze caught a cold?

11:32.980 --> 11:34.110
Yes.

11:34.190 --> 11:37.740
I wanted to visit him in person.

11:37.820 --> 11:40.120
But unfortunately, I'm busy today.

11:40.200 --> 11:41.080
I see.

11:41.160 --> 11:42.370
Okay, I can help you.

11:42.450 --> 11:43.990
Really?

11:44.080 --> 11:48.120
Then, this is the cold medicine
Masachika always takes,

11:48.210 --> 11:49.710
along with his home address.

11:49.790 --> 11:51.000
I'm counting on you.

11:51.090 --> 11:54.130
All right, I'll stop by after school.

11:54.210 --> 11:55.590
Actually,

11:55.670 --> 11:57.970
I have one more favor to ask.

11:58.050 --> 11:59.140
What is it?

11:59.220 --> 12:00.680
If it's okay with you,

12:00.760 --> 12:02.890
could you be our guest tomorrow

12:02.970 --> 12:05.100
for the school's midday broadcast?

12:05.180 --> 12:06.140
What?

12:06.730 --> 12:10.560
Because I'd like to talk about
the last general meeting tomorrow.

12:10.650 --> 12:11.770
Tomorrow?

12:11.860 --> 12:12.690
Yes.

12:12.770 --> 12:14.900
It's a good opportunity for more students

12:14.980 --> 12:17.030
to remember that victory, right?

12:18.740 --> 12:20.200
I'm sorry,

12:20.280 --> 12:23.160
but I don't want to talk about that now.

12:23.240 --> 12:25.410
Oh dear, I see.

12:26.000 --> 12:29.120
Well then, how about
I just invite you as our guest

12:29.210 --> 12:31.290
without talking about the general meeting?

12:31.380 --> 12:32.290
What?

12:32.380 --> 12:35.170
After all, this is the last event report
for the first semester.

12:35.250 --> 12:36.670
What do you think? Okay, right?

12:36.760 --> 12:38.670
Yeah, I guess it's okay

12:38.760 --> 12:40.180
if that's the case.

12:40.930 --> 12:42.430
Thank you.

12:45.060 --> 12:46.430
By the way,

12:46.520 --> 12:48.480
you and Masachika

12:48.560 --> 12:52.020
really want to invalidate
the victory of that general meeting.

12:52.770 --> 12:54.520
I'm impressed you noticed it.

12:55.020 --> 12:56.820
Of course, I can tell.

12:56.900 --> 12:58.400
I've been hearing rumors lately

12:58.490 --> 13:01.200
that Nonoa cheated in the general meeting.

13:01.280 --> 13:04.200
I figured it out
once no one tried to refute it.

13:06.080 --> 13:07.700
Seriously.

13:07.790 --> 13:10.750
How can you be so relaxed, Alisa?

13:11.370 --> 13:14.420
Are you really planning
to take me on seriously?

13:14.920 --> 13:16.130
What?

13:23.180 --> 13:25.180
Without any defense,

13:25.260 --> 13:28.220
you nonchalantly enter my home turf.

13:28.310 --> 13:30.680
Aren't you being too careless?

13:31.310 --> 13:33.980
You're so unguarded.

13:34.860 --> 13:38.110
I can't help but want
to give you some advice.

13:38.650 --> 13:40.740
So it's not merely a guest appearance?

13:40.820 --> 13:42.990
You finally realized it?

13:43.070 --> 13:46.280
When I came to talk to you
while Masachika was on sick leave,

13:46.370 --> 13:48.410
you should have been on your guard.

13:48.490 --> 13:49.410
Don't tell me

13:49.500 --> 13:50.620
you did it on purpose?

13:50.700 --> 13:51.620
<i>That's right.</i>

13:51.710 --> 13:54.960
<i>I want to use this opportunity
to crush you as much as I can.</i>

13:55.460 --> 13:56.500
In other words,

13:56.590 --> 13:57.710
you assumed that

13:57.800 --> 14:01.130
I alone would be at your mercy
once I set foot on your home turf?

14:01.720 --> 14:03.430
You're totally underestimating me.

14:05.050 --> 14:08.640
Of course, I don't mind
if you want to rely on Masachika.

14:09.640 --> 14:11.140
There's no need.

14:11.230 --> 14:14.770
I won't add to his burden
at a time like this.

14:14.850 --> 14:16.860
Goodness, really?

14:16.940 --> 14:18.730
Then I'm looking forward

14:18.820 --> 14:21.110
to your performance
worthy of the name "Solitary Princess."

14:23.360 --> 14:25.610
There's no way I'll lose.

14:26.870 --> 14:27.700
Of course.

14:27.780 --> 14:30.040
I came up
with all possible countermeasures.

14:30.120 --> 14:32.370
And today, after school…

14:33.370 --> 14:35.330
Alya, I'm sorry!

14:35.880 --> 14:38.790
What are you apologizing for?

14:39.380 --> 14:44.130
For the nasty way I treated you yesterday.

14:44.630 --> 14:47.180
After all, you're my important friend.

14:47.260 --> 14:49.760
To challenge you
in such a backstabbing way

14:49.850 --> 14:51.100
was very painful for me.

14:51.770 --> 14:54.180
In order to get rid of my confusion,

14:54.270 --> 14:57.100
I took such an aggressive approach.

14:57.650 --> 15:00.770
I know it was shameless of me.

15:00.860 --> 15:05.200
But I really don't want
to lose you as a friend.

15:07.780 --> 15:09.280
Hey, that's enough.

15:09.370 --> 15:10.950
Raise your head.

15:11.040 --> 15:12.290
Does this mean

15:12.370 --> 15:15.040
you'll forgive me?

15:16.750 --> 15:19.590
That also means
you value this very much, right?

15:20.170 --> 15:21.500
Thank you.

15:22.630 --> 15:24.090
That's great.

15:26.340 --> 15:28.760
This might sound like an excuse,

15:28.840 --> 15:30.180
but I have a reason

15:30.260 --> 15:34.100
to win the presidential election
at all costs.

15:34.180 --> 15:35.350
Reason?

15:36.270 --> 15:38.900
I had an older brother.

15:40.440 --> 15:44.280
<i>He was more outstanding than me.</i>

15:44.360 --> 15:48.360
<i>That's why my parents and grandfather
had high hopes for him</i>

15:48.450 --> 15:51.740
<i>and believed that he would be
a great successor to the Suou family.</i>

15:52.660 --> 15:55.370
But he's gone now.

15:55.450 --> 15:56.710
What?

15:56.790 --> 15:59.000
In place of my absent brother,

15:59.080 --> 16:02.500
I have to work hard to live up
to my family's expectations.

16:03.050 --> 16:04.250
Because that's…

16:04.340 --> 16:07.130
the duty I must undertake for staying.

16:09.680 --> 16:11.600
It's almost time to begin.

16:11.680 --> 16:13.310
Are you ready?

16:13.390 --> 16:14.430
Yeah.

16:15.850 --> 16:17.390
Come to think of it,

16:17.480 --> 16:19.190
what about you, Alya?

16:19.270 --> 16:20.100
What?

16:20.190 --> 16:21.360
Alya,

16:21.440 --> 16:24.190
why do you want
to be the student council president?

16:27.440 --> 16:28.740
Well…

16:28.820 --> 16:29.860
It's time.

16:29.950 --> 16:31.200
Let's get started.

16:33.280 --> 16:34.990
Good afternoon, everyone.

16:35.080 --> 16:38.580
Today, I, the student council's
PR officer, Yuki Suou,

16:38.660 --> 16:41.960
will give you an update
on the student council's activities.

16:42.040 --> 16:42.880
Now,

16:42.960 --> 16:45.210
we have an excellent guest with us.

16:49.170 --> 16:50.510
I'm Alisa Kujou,

16:50.590 --> 16:52.090
the student council's treasurer.

16:52.180 --> 16:55.350
Well, it's nice to meet you today.

16:56.470 --> 16:59.270
I guess you do get
a little nervous in this setting.

17:01.440 --> 17:02.900
After that,

17:02.980 --> 17:04.570
it was a complete mess.

17:05.070 --> 17:06.780
<i>That's cruel.</i>

17:06.860 --> 17:08.860
<i>She purposely issued
a challenge villainously</i>

17:08.940 --> 17:10.740
<i>and ignited Alya's fighting spirit.</i>

17:11.320 --> 17:13.280
<i>On the day itself,
as if to arouse sympathy,</i>

17:13.370 --> 17:15.870
<i>she said, "I'm fighting
because my family expects me to."</i>

17:15.950 --> 17:18.250
<i>"Then what about you?"</i>

17:19.160 --> 17:20.250
I'm so frustrated.

17:21.000 --> 17:23.250
I panicked so easily.

17:23.330 --> 17:25.340
In the end, I couldn't do anything.

17:29.090 --> 17:30.670
All right, stop that.

17:30.760 --> 17:33.180
Your thoughts are heading
in a bad direction.

17:33.260 --> 17:35.010
Bad direction?

17:35.100 --> 17:38.140
I mean, you fell for Yuki's trap.

17:38.220 --> 17:39.680
Yuki's goal

17:39.770 --> 17:42.810
isn't to use today's broadcast
to gain the upper hand.

17:42.900 --> 17:44.100
Think about it carefully.

17:44.190 --> 17:45.400
It's only a half-day today.

17:45.480 --> 17:48.150
There aren't many students left on campus.

17:48.230 --> 17:49.900
If she wants to showcase dominance,

17:49.990 --> 17:52.820
there must be
a more effective time to do so.

17:53.740 --> 17:55.700
So, the closing ceremony
is the main event,

17:55.780 --> 17:58.040
and the school broadcast
is just an opening act?

17:58.120 --> 17:59.700
That's right.

18:00.200 --> 18:02.710
I think she's trying to disrupt your pace.

18:03.370 --> 18:06.090
She must've been looking forward

18:06.170 --> 18:07.630
to seeing you in low spirits.

18:07.710 --> 18:10.210
But you were just frustrated.

18:15.220 --> 18:17.260
I got it. Thank you.

18:19.560 --> 18:21.520
Why are you smiling?

18:24.690 --> 18:25.850
<i>It's true.</i>

18:28.360 --> 18:31.280
Nothing. I just thought,
"Wow, she pulled that on me."

18:31.990 --> 18:33.700
How should I put it?

18:33.780 --> 18:36.280
I think I'm getting excited too.

18:39.660 --> 18:43.290
That's a great expression too.

18:46.880 --> 18:48.590
I couldn't answer her then.

18:48.670 --> 18:49.670
Answer what?

18:49.750 --> 18:53.130
She asked me why I wanted
to be the student council president.

18:53.220 --> 18:55.680
But I couldn't answer her.

18:56.260 --> 18:57.300
Yuki.

18:57.390 --> 18:58.720
For the sake of her family,

18:58.800 --> 19:01.770
she's fighting to win this election
with such determination.

19:02.270 --> 19:06.440
But I'm only doing this for myself.

19:06.520 --> 19:07.900
When I thought about that,

19:07.980 --> 19:09.610
I couldn't say anything.

19:11.020 --> 19:13.320
I'm ashamed of myself
for panicking like that.

19:13.900 --> 19:15.530
In front of Yuki,

19:15.610 --> 19:18.700
I couldn't answer her
with my head held high.

19:18.780 --> 19:19.990
I'm so frustrated!

19:20.910 --> 19:22.830
Alya, look ahead!

19:23.910 --> 19:27.000
Compared to Yuki,
your reason for running is nothing?

19:27.080 --> 19:28.330
So what?

19:28.420 --> 19:30.290
Didn't I tell you before?

19:30.380 --> 19:34.210
You can get a lot of support
with what you're doing now.

19:34.800 --> 19:36.050
I know it.

19:36.130 --> 19:37.470
You're more sincere than anyone,

19:37.550 --> 19:40.350
and you'll give your best
no matter what you do.

19:41.430 --> 19:42.600
So,

19:42.680 --> 19:44.100
look straight ahead.

19:44.180 --> 19:45.310
Don't worry.

19:45.390 --> 19:49.060
You're just as charming as Yuki.

19:49.560 --> 19:51.400
I can guarantee that.

19:55.860 --> 19:58.820
That sounds like a love confession.

19:58.910 --> 19:59.910
Shut up!

19:59.990 --> 20:02.120
I'm not going to say it a second time!

20:02.200 --> 20:04.330
Good grief, it's so hot!

20:04.410 --> 20:06.540
It's starting to burn again.

20:07.040 --> 20:08.290
Thank you.

20:08.370 --> 20:09.460
Thanks to you,

20:09.540 --> 20:11.340
I'm not confused anymore.

20:12.750 --> 20:14.460
That's good.

20:14.550 --> 20:15.670
You're right.

20:15.760 --> 20:18.180
Comparing myself to others is pointless.

20:19.470 --> 20:20.970
Even if Yuki is carrying on

20:21.050 --> 20:24.510
her late brother's will,
I can't back down.

20:26.060 --> 20:28.480
<i>Hey, little sister!</i>

20:28.560 --> 20:31.480
<i>You made her think that I'm dead!</i>

20:31.560 --> 20:33.900
Well… Alya.

20:33.980 --> 20:35.190
Hello.

20:35.940 --> 20:38.990
Wait, aren't you on leave today?

20:39.070 --> 20:40.610
Sorry to bother you.

20:40.700 --> 20:42.620
Yes, I just got here.

20:42.700 --> 20:44.120
I see.

20:44.200 --> 20:46.910
Nonoa, that's uncouth.

20:47.000 --> 20:50.790
It doesn't matter, right?
There's no one else here.

20:51.290 --> 20:53.130
So, what's up?

20:54.040 --> 20:56.090
I know it's late,

20:56.170 --> 20:58.170
but Kuze, Kujou,

20:58.260 --> 21:01.260
I'd like to apologize
for all the rude things I've done to you.

21:02.090 --> 21:04.300
I'm truly sorry.

21:05.260 --> 21:07.060
I'm sorry too.

21:07.140 --> 21:10.230
I'm also responsible
for not stopping her in time.

21:10.310 --> 21:11.400
I know it's late,

21:11.480 --> 21:12.940
but will you forgive us?

21:13.560 --> 21:16.280
That depends on whether Alya
is willing to forgive you.

21:16.360 --> 21:18.900
Since you've apologized
for what you've said,

21:18.990 --> 21:19.990
I'll let it go.

21:20.070 --> 21:21.570
Besides, Miyamae,

21:21.660 --> 21:24.240
you didn't do anything to apologize for.

21:24.320 --> 21:28.870
No, the ones setting up shills
usually have to apologize.

21:29.580 --> 21:31.830
There was no mention
of the general meeting

21:31.920 --> 21:33.500
in the school broadcast today.

21:33.580 --> 21:35.500
Were you being considerate of me too?

21:35.590 --> 21:38.210
I just don't want to declare victory

21:38.300 --> 21:41.510
because it wasn't a clear win.

21:42.300 --> 21:44.180
I see.

21:44.260 --> 21:46.010
How noble of you.

21:46.600 --> 21:49.020
But I have my pride too.

21:49.600 --> 21:51.140
Hold on, Taniyama.

21:51.230 --> 21:52.640
What are you trying to do?

21:53.230 --> 21:55.610
I don't want to distort the truth

21:55.690 --> 21:57.900
to protect my reputation.

21:57.980 --> 22:01.860
So you're not announcing victory,
but defeat?

22:02.360 --> 22:04.070
Through the school broadcast…

22:04.160 --> 22:05.780
No, at the closing ceremony?

22:06.370 --> 22:07.200
I'm sorry.

22:07.280 --> 22:08.540
As a student council member,

22:08.620 --> 22:12.160
I can't let you do as you please
at the closing ceremony.

22:12.250 --> 22:15.170
If you want to reciprocate
Alya's sincerity,

22:15.250 --> 22:17.670
can you do it in another way?

22:18.750 --> 22:20.420
Another way?

22:21.920 --> 22:23.050
Are you serious?

22:23.130 --> 22:24.050
Of course.

22:24.130 --> 22:28.510
I don't intend to support you.

22:28.600 --> 22:29.510
Even now,

22:29.600 --> 22:32.600
I still think you should run with Suou.

22:32.680 --> 22:33.890
I see.

22:33.980 --> 22:36.560
But you should somewhat understand

22:36.650 --> 22:38.690
why I chose Alya, right?

22:43.070 --> 22:44.700
All right.

22:44.780 --> 22:47.410
Seriously?

22:49.240 --> 22:51.910
Well then, I can help too.

22:52.000 --> 22:54.790
Thank you. I look forward to your support.

22:54.870 --> 22:57.380
Alya, this is your power.

22:57.460 --> 22:59.290
With this, we can beat them.

22:59.380 --> 23:01.000
What? Beat them?

23:01.090 --> 23:02.760
Aren't we aiming for a draw?

23:02.840 --> 23:05.010
I've decided otherwise.

23:05.590 --> 23:07.590
If they're going to play dirty like this,

23:08.220 --> 23:10.220
let's crush them mercilessly.
